Package: nbzinbCirkovic
Title: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("David", "Cirkovic", email = "cirkovd2@miamioh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits negative binomial (NB2) regression by iteratively reweighted least squares (IRLS) alternated with Newton-Raphson updates of log(theta), and zero-inflated negative binomial regression by an EM algorithm whose M-steps are IRLS fits. Estimation is implemented from scratch, without general-purpose optimizers.
